WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.706
The macOS kernel

00:00:01.718 --> 00:00:02.555
loaded as a

00:00:02.366 --> 00:00:03.569
Linux module

00:00:04.086 --> 00:00:05.902
xnulinux builds XNU

00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:07.647
the open-source macOS

00:00:07.459 --> 00:00:08.071
kernel

00:00:08.131 --> 00:00:09.380
from Apple's sources

00:00:09.227 --> 00:00:10.041
and loads it

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:10.654
as a kernel

00:00:10.466 --> 00:00:11.892
module inside an

00:00:11.786 --> 00:00:14.109
unmodified arm64 Linux

00:00:14.638 --> 00:00:15.451
On a stock

00:00:15.263 --> 00:00:16.277
Ubuntu kernel

00:00:16.513 --> 00:00:17.621
one insmod boots

00:00:17.504 --> 00:00:19.060
a macOS 27

00:00:18.872 --> 00:00:19.814
disk all the

00:00:19.626 --> 00:00:20.180
way to the

00:00:19.992 --> 00:00:20.734
desktop

00:00:20.794 --> 00:00:21.701
with Finder

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:23.305
the Dock Safari

00:00:23.117 --> 00:00:23.942
and Chrome

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:26.026
There's no hypervisor

00:00:26.165 --> 00:00:27.934
macOS processes run

00:00:27.757 --> 00:00:29.054
natively beside Linux

00:00:28.866 --> 00:00:29.408
ones

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:30.422
while a small

00:00:30.234 --> 00:00:31.884
module lends XNU

00:00:31.696 --> 00:00:32.851
Linux's memory

00:00:32.993 --> 00:00:33.747
files

00:00:33.807 --> 00:00:35.328
network and GPU

00:00:35.862 --> 00:00:36.876
Full story on

00:00:36.687 --> 00:00:37.583
the dashboard
